{"id": "1479950822765756487", "channel_id": "1300659753197764688", "author_id": "899814369926471750", "author_name": "shiio4870", "content": "Prediksi sementara, dia bisa bareng Gmurphy, Tulu, Miryam, Thais, Gdoll, atau Ramona sekalipun.\nMasalah must pull atau nggak, semua di kembalikan ke keyakinan masing2. Klw scr kit sih, WoD nya bagus. Soal apakah harus di pull / tidak, kembali pada tabungan masing2", "timestamp": "2026-03-07T21:16:12.304000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["776430494572085268"], "reactions": [{"emoji": "👍", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}], "reply_to": "1479945711641432196"}
{"id": "1479952335626309693", "channel_id": "1300659753197764688", "author_id": "899814369926471750", "author_name": "shiio4870", "content": "Soal Vortice.\nDia status nya Sub-Dps klw diliat dr kit. Damage dia tergantung kawan. Tipe follow up support.\nCara mainnya, trigger pursuit 3x > Exalt.\nBenefit ke realm mastery, Ailemus Regen.\n\n\nSoal Dupe,\nE1 Breakpoint.\nE2 Optimal.\nE3 Ideal.\nE7/ OE Luxury.\n\nWoD, borderline optional.\nKalo g bisa pull, bisa diganti pake WoD yg support realm mastery / Ailemus regen\n(Krn base ailemus dia 200. 2x lipat dr normal awaker)\n\nCove, so far bagus di cove ch 6. Tidak menutup kemungkinan untuk bisa pake cove Gdoll", "timestamp": "2026-03-07T21:22:12.998000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "👍", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}]}
